    {
      "title": "Phase 1: Initialization\n1: Input: Document set V = {d1, d2, . . . , dn},\nquery q, similarity function sim(\u00b7, \u00b7), embedding\nmodel f(\u00b7), initial cluster size \u03c4 , threshold \u039b\n2: Output: Clusters {C1, C2, . . . , Ck}\n3: Compute query embedding: vq \u2190 f(q)\n4: for all dj \u2208 V do\n5: Compute embedding: vj \u2190 f(dj )\n6: end for\n7: Select initial cluster root:\nC.R1 \u2190 arg maxd\u2208V sim(vq, vj )\n8: for all dj \u2208 V do\n9: Compute similarity: sj \u2190 sim(vC.R1\n, vj )\n10: end for\n11: Form C1 with top-\u03c4 documents from V sorted\nby sj\n12: Remove C1 members from V\nPhase 2: Iterative Subgraph Formation\n1: k \u2190 2\n2: while V \u0338= \u2205 do\n3: Select new root:\nC.Rk \u2190 arg maxd\u2208V sim(vq, vj )\n4: for all dj \u2208 V do\n5: Compute similarity:\nsj \u2190 sim(vC.Rk\n, vj )\n6: end for\n7: Determine cluster size:\nsize \u2190 min(2 \u00d7 |Ck\u22121|, \u039b)\n8: Form Ck with top-size documents from V\nsorted by sj\n9: Remove Ck members from V\n10: k \u2190 k + 1\n11: end while",
